# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Line endings
#
# Store every text file as LF in the repository *and* in the working tree.
# Without this, a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true) keeps rewriting files
# between LF and CRLF: git prints "LF will be replaced by CRLF the next time
# Git touches it" on every push, and a handful of files had ended up committed
# with genuinely mixed line endings (some lines LF, some CRLF), which made them
# show up as fully modified in every diff.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never convert, never diff as text
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.jpeg   binary
*.gif    binary
*.ico    binary
*.webp   binary
*.avif   binary
*.woff   binary
*.woff2  binary
*.ttf    binary
*.otf    binary
*.eot    binary
*.zip    binary
*.mp3    binary
*.mp4    binary
